<view class="page chat-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-row">
      <view class="hero-mark">
        <ui-icon name="spark" size="40" color="#5C7A5A"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="eyebrow">COZE</text>
        <text class="hero-title">智学助手</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-sub">选课学习走课程页的智学课堂。这里只回答临时备课问题，不会和某门课的环节进度混在一起。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="thread" scroll-into-view="{{scrollInto}}" scroll-with-animation>
    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!messages.length}}">
      <view class="empty-icon">
        <ui-icon name="chat" size="48" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      先去课程目录点一门课，按智学自己的流程上课。这里适合问临时的话术或案例，不计入课程进度。
    </view>
    <view
      id="m-{{item.id}}"
      class="bubble {{item.role === 'user' ? 'me' : 'bot'}}"
      wx:for="{{messages}}"
      wx:key="id"
    >{{item.content}}</view>
    <view class="follow-wrap" wx:if="{{followUps.length && !sending}}">
      <view class="muted">智学建议</view>
      <view
        class="follow"
        wx:for="{{followUps}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-text="{{item}}"
        bindtap="onFollow"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted thinking" wx:if="{{sending}}">
      <ui-icon name="spark" size="28" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
      <text>智学思考中…</text>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="composer">
    <view class="draft-row">
      <textarea
        class="draft"
        placeholder="{{recording ? '正在听，松手后转成文字' : '输入或按住右侧麦克风说话'}}"
        value="{{draft}}"
        bindinput="onDraft"
        auto-height
        maxlength="2000"
        confirm-type="send"
        bindconfirm="onSend"
      ></textarea>
      <view
        class="mic {{recording ? 'on' : ''}}"
        catchtouchstart="onMicStart"
        catchtouchend="onMicEnd"
        catchtouchcancel="onMicEnd"
      >
        <ui-icon name="mic" size="36" color="{{recording ? '#FFFFFF' : '#5C7A5A'}}"></ui-icon>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="row composer-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost mini" size="mini" bindtap="onClear">清空</button>
      <button class="btn mini" size="mini" bindtap="onSend" disabled="{{sending}}">发送</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
